SUMMARY:AVL International Connections - December Mix & Mingle
DESCRIPTION:AVL International Connections\nFor our **December Internationa
 l Mix & Mingle** we will gather on the beautiful riverside deck @ New Belg
 ium Brewery (River Arts District)! If you are new\, there will be lots of 
 folks to welcome you!! If you haven't come for a few months\, come and mee
 t some new folks!\n\nWeather permitting\, we will be outside on New Belgiu
 m’s beautiful deck overlooking the river. If it is chilly or raining\, w
 e’ll move inside to the taproom. Look for the Meetup signs and the AVL I
 nternational Connections' name tags. Grab a cold beverage and then join us
 !\n\nA local Food Truck will also be out front if anyone wants a bite to e
 at!\n\nAs a growing group (over **1600** members)\, if you have friends th
 at you would like to bring along\, please do! Also encourage them to sign 
 up on Meetup!
